  clock: 3  # ec3f
  nonce: ec3f  # ec3f
  message: "Fixed in PR (pending merge). Only call-flow edge types (calls, routes_to, wraps, ipc_calls, implements_rpc, grpc_calls, wasm_bridge) count toward out-degree in pick_reverse_slice_seeds. dispatches_to/implements/extends/contains no longer inflate interface method out-degree."  # ec3f
